(i) Detect versions of services running
$ nmap -sV 192.168.1.10
Starting Nmap
Nmap scan report for 192.168.1.10
PORT     STATE SERVICE VERSION
22/tcp   open  ssh     OpenSSH
80/tcp   open  http    Apache httpd
443/tcp  open  https   Apache httpd
Nmap done

(ii) Aggressive scan
$ nmap -A 192.168.1.10
Starting Nmap
